1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 20=

2
00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:29,620
A few pages are missing.

3
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,500
Xiaozhu.

4
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,780
I did say I liked smart girls.

5
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:43,580
But when they're too smart,

6
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,100
they become rather unlikable.

7
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,660
I can help you deal with Dong Zhenglun.

8
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,540
But please leave Ding Yiyi alone.

9
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:55,980
And leave my sister alone.

10
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,260
Is that so?

11
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:06,860
What did you inject me with?

12
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:11,060
I was afraid you'd lose your nerve
on your first assignment.

13
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,700
Just giving you a little confidence.

14
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,300
Xiaozhu.

15
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:29,020
I actually had high hopes for you.

16
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:31,460
You and I are alike.

17
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:33,860
We were both abandoned

18
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:36,500
but fought hard to survive.

19
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:38,100
We could have joined forces

20
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:39,500
and accomplished so much together.

21
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:43,900
But you just had to...

22
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,540
You just had to ruin my plans.

23
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:59,160
(Mei Yuhe's Tailor Shop)

24
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:08,300
She wanted to use her death

25
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,820
to draw public attention to everything.

26
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,380
Looking back,

27
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,980
Xiaozhu deliberately
came to me for a loan.

28
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:17,580
She knew you wouldn't
acknowledge that debt,

29
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:19,540
and I'd stop at nothing to collect it.

30
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:21,420
That way, the two of us
could work together

31
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:23,260
to uncover what happened to Yiyi

32
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:24,500
and what happened to Lisa.

33
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:27,500
And Yijie

34
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:30,300
was the one who took over
the investigation,

35
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:31,860
secretly helping us

36
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:33,220
and passing information to us.

37
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:34,380
I never imagined

38
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:36,540
she'd planned everything so carefully,

39
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:38,500
even what would happen after her death.

40
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:41,140
Yuhe.

41
00:03:42,220 --> 00:03:44,660
Thank goodness you
believed in her all along.

42
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:48,540
That's why we've been
able to uncover so much.

43
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:50,100
Yes.

44
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,540
Believing in her

45
00:03:54,510 --> 00:03:56,800
was the best decision I ever made.

46
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,960
(Written by Yan Qing)

47
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,180
Extra!

48
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:33,460
Extra!

49
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:35,100
Cat Training Register exposed!

50
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:36,580
The truth behind a ruthless
organization revealed!

51
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:37,580
I'll take a copy.

52
00:04:39,060 --> 00:04:40,220
Extra!

53
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:41,420
Extra!

54
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,620
Cat Training Register exposed!

55
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,060
The truth behind a ruthless
organization revealed!

56
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:47,940
Extra!

57
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:50,460
Extra!

58
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:51,460
Extra!

59
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:52,660
Cat Training Register exposed!

60
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:54,060
The truth behind a ruthless
organization revealed!

61
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:59,260
Is it true that
Kun Society's senior members

62
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:00,420
exploited women, as reported
in the White Paper?

63
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:01,420
Did Lv Mengde give you women

64
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,060
to bribe senior officials?

65
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:03,420
- Get these reporters out of here!
- Are the deaths of these women

66
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:04,460
connected to Kun Society?

67
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,020
Bank President Qin, answer us!

68
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:08,820
Bank President Qin, answer us!

69
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:11,820
Director Kong.

70
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:13,220
Your name appears in the White Paper.

71
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:13,980
It accuses you of accepting

72
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,420
women supplied by Lv Mengde.

73
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:16,980
Don't you think
you owe us an explanation?

74
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:18,180
Give us an answer!

75
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:19,180
Get out of my way!

76
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:20,620
Shouldn't Kun Society answer

77
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:22,020
for the deaths of these women?

78
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:23,740
(Cat Training Register Exposes a Terrible Truth)
Doesn't Kun Society owe us an explanation?

79
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:25,020
Give the public an answer!

80
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:25,820
You owe us an explanation!

81
00:05:25,820 --> 00:05:26,500
An explanation?

82
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,500
I'll give you nothing!

83
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:31,540
- Don't leave! Wait!
- Wait!

84
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:34,020
- Don't leave!
- Come back!

85
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:35,640
- Give us an explanation!
- Come back!

86
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:36,260
Come back!

87
00:05:43,020 --> 00:05:44,020
Boss Long Feng.

88
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:46,700
How do you explain this?

89
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:49,260
Isn't this perfect?

90
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:51,700
We can put an end to our old business

91
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,980
and take the opportunity
to launch a new one.

92
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:57,140
You think simply
announcing a new business

93
00:05:58,020 --> 00:06:00,220
will calm the situation?

94
00:06:00,620 --> 00:06:02,460
It's just a battle for
public opinion, isn't it?

95
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:05,020
I'm more than ready to take them on.

96
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:06,540
Rest assured.

97
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:08,060
I'll make sure

98
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:11,260
the public's attention

99
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:13,500
shifts away from Kun Society.

100
00:06:13,860 --> 00:06:14,900
How will you do that?

101
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,520
(Manuscript)

102
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,740
Come take a look!

103
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,180
I received an anonymous letter.

104
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,460
I've received a whole bunch today too.

105
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,260
Same here.

106
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:28,860
What is all this?

107
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:30,140
Who sent these lists?

108
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:31,700
Are they connected to Kun Society?

109
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:32,730
This is all information
about the victims!

110
00:06:32,730 --> 00:06:33,720
Where did it come from?

111
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:34,800
Who cares?

112
00:06:34,860 --> 00:06:35,900
Getting it published is what matters.

113
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:37,300
This is even more sensational
than the White Paper.

114
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,780
These girls

115
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:40,980
will attract more attention than the photos
of those bosses in the White Paper.

116
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,810
(Give Me Back My Daughter)
Give me back my daughter!

117
00:06:45,810 --> 00:06:46,640
(Severely Punish the Powerful Murderers)

118
00:06:47,060 --> 00:06:49,220
What are you police officers even doing?

119
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:50,500
(Give Me Back My Daughter's Life)
You're all lying!

120
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:52,180
My daughter didn't just go missing!

121
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:53,540
Give me an explanation!

122
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,660
The killers must pay with their lives!

123
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:56,260
Make the Kun Society bosses come out!

124
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:57,220
You're covering up their crimes!

125
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:58,540
You're all in this together!

126
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:00,220
Give me back my daughter!

127
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:01,340
You can't believe

128
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,260
everything you read in the papers!

129
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,340
You can't take it all as truth!

130
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:04,020
That's enough!

131
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:04,660
Shame on you!

132
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:05,780
What's all this?

133
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:06,940
Take another step,

134
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:07,980
and I'll shoot!

135
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:12,380
Stop shouting!

136
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:13,580
What's all this noise?

137
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:15,820
If you think the police
have failed in their duty,

138
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,140
you can take it to court.

139
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:18,700
But if your daughters

140
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,260
led improper lives
and chased after wealth and glamour

141
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:21,060
until they ruined themselves,

142
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,300
then you failed as parents.

143
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:24,380
What's the job of the police?

144
00:07:24,420 --> 00:07:25,220
To investigate crimes

145
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,220
and maintain public order.

146
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:28,020
We don't have time to discipline
your children for you.

147
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,180
Anyone who keeps causing trouble

148
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,420
will be arrested!

149
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:32,640
How could this happen?

150
00:07:32,700 --> 00:07:34,110
How could the newspapers
print such things?

151
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:34,700
Impossible!

152
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:36,100
My daughter would never
go to a dance hall!

153
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:36,940
I told you, it takes two to tango!

154
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:37,820
Look! You just had to drag me
out here to be humiliated!

155
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:38,980
As far as I'm concerned,
she's no daughter of mine!

156
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,140
This is slander! These are lies!

157
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:40,900
(Shocking Secrets Revealed)
No wonder my sister suddenly changed so much.

158
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:41,660
(New Era Women Attend Night School)
They're not their children, after all.

159
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:42,180
(and Visit Dance Halls)
So that's what they're like!

160
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:43,460
My daughter was deceived.

161
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,140
Our daughter would never do such things!

162
00:07:45,140 --> 00:07:46,500
How could they do this?

163
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:47,940
It's an injustice!

164
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:50,820
Can the Sanxun Gathering still go ahead?

165
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:52,980
There's chaos everywhere outside.

166
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:55,340
It must go ahead.

167
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:56,820
We can't break our
ancestors' traditions.

168
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:58,100
Yes, that makes sense.

169
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,460
If you go out there now,

170
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:00,900
those furious people

171
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:02,380
will chase you down
and throw rotten eggs at you.

172
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:04,380
As for me,

173
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,700
I've done none of the things
reported in the papers.

174
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:08,380
I've got nothing to hide.

175
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:09,700
Who knows if that's true?

176
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:10,620
- Exactly.
- That's right.

177
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:11,620
Boss Kuang.

178
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,620
Your name is on the list too.

179
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:14,820
What do you think?

180
00:08:15,420 --> 00:08:16,660
Do you dare go outside?

181
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:21,060
Why wouldn't I dare?

182
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:23,740
If we let such a trivial matter

183
00:08:23,820 --> 00:08:25,900
interfere with preparations
for the Sanxun Gathering,

184
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:27,780
and word gets out,

185
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:29,580
Kun Society will become a laughingstock.

186
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,880
At the end of the day,

187
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,900
women are to blame for all this.

188
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:38,620
They're insatiably greedy

189
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:40,020
and obsessed with wealth and glamour.

190
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:42,140
We paid for our pleasures.

191
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:43,380
We didn't take anything for free.

192
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:45,380
There's nothing wrong with that.

193
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:47,580
Besides,

194
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:50,700
don't we have a procession of prisoners?

195
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:52,300
That's right.

196
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,940
When families suffer misfortune,

197
00:08:54,980 --> 00:08:55,940
it's the women's fault.

198
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:58,500
My own wife is quite a fierce woman.

199
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:01,460
Especially at a time like this,

200
00:09:01,780 --> 00:09:02,860
we must take to the streets

201
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:05,420
and sincerely pray to
the gods for protection.

202
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:06,540
Well said.

203
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:08,460
You're promoting the New Life Movement,

204
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,580
yet you still believe
in worshipping gods?

205
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:13,620
What's wrong with my New Life Movement?

206
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:14,220
What are you implying?

207
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,140
You know exactly what I mean!

208
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:17,060
That's enough.

209
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:19,220
Let's stop arguing.

210
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:22,380
Boss Ren is here!

211
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:32,700
The Sanxun Gathering affects
people's livelihoods.

212
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:34,740
It's an important annual event.

213
00:09:35,620 --> 00:09:38,860
We must carry on with the preparations.

214
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:46,780
If

215
00:09:47,660 --> 00:09:49,340
a few small newspapers

216
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,260
criticizing Kun Society

217
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,780
can stop the Sanxun Gathering,

218
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:56,660
wouldn't that be telling the world

219
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:59,260
that Kun Society admits its crimes

220
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:01,580
and is afraid and hiding?

221
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:03,460
Is that what you want?

222
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:04,580
Boss Ren is right.

223
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,380
This year's Sanxun Gathering

224
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:08,780
must not only go ahead,

225
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,660
but be bigger and grander than ever.

226
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:13,180
Let the people celebrate together

227
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:15,140
as they pay tribute to the City God.

228
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:18,300
Is everything taken care of?

229
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:20,300
Everything's taken care of.

230
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:21,580
Our newspapers

231
00:10:21,820 --> 00:10:24,860
are attracting far more
attention than the White Paper.

232
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,140
How did the other newspapers get

233
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:36,420
this list of victims?

234
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:39,100
Are you suspecting me?

235
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:41,940
I'm just worried

236
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:44,740
about whether that underground
printing house is reliable.

237
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:46,700
They only print what we give them.

238
00:10:46,900 --> 00:10:48,340
How could they know any of this?

239
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:51,580
We may have overlooked someone.

240
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:54,500
Long Feng.

241
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:56,140
Look.

242
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:57,980
These reports

243
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:00,260
are focusing heavily on
the female victims' backgrounds.

244
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:02,300
What they liked to do,

245
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,340
what they liked to wear.

246
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:04,420
I'd say

247
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,660
whoever has this list

248
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:09,060
and wants to divert public attention

249
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:11,220
away from the men
who committed the crimes

250
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:13,700
must be Long Feng
and the people backing her.

251
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,620
Who else could it be?

252
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:16,820
She's a woman herself.

253
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:18,980
How could she do this?

254
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:21,980
In this world,

255
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:25,020
only by dragging women through the mud

256
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:26,700
can those people escape responsibility.

257
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,300
The Sanxun Gathering
will still go ahead as planned.

258
00:11:32,620 --> 00:11:33,340
I've already obtained

259
00:11:33,340 --> 00:11:34,700
the list of participants
in the prisoner procession.

260
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,860
Pretend to be prisoners?

261
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:36,660
That's right.

262
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:40,060
Each family will send
a woman dressed as a prisoner

263
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:42,300
to be escorted through the streets
by the Underworld Court.

264
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:44,180
People will throw vegetable leaves
and stones at them.

265
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:45,680
They'll bear punishment
on behalf of their families

266
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:46,780
to ward off illness and disaster.

267
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:48,500
Kuang Jinpeng is
extremely superstitious.

268
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:50,140
He's already signed up Ding Yiyi

269
00:11:50,420 --> 00:11:51,860
and Kuang Yinyue.

270
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:53,020
That's perfect.

271
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:55,540
We can use this
opportunity to rescue her.

272
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:56,940
I don't even know

273
00:11:57,580 --> 00:11:59,300
whether she'd still be
willing to leave with me.

274
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,420
When she called you last time,

275
00:12:00,420 --> 00:12:01,660
she was asking for help.

276
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:02,660
In that case,

277
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:05,060
let's print some more posters

278
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:06,780
and hand them out on the day
of the Sanxun Gathering.

279
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:08,140
We'll reach more people that way.

280
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:09,340
And if it causes a disturbance,

281
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:10,780
it'll be easier for us to rescue them.

282
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:29,040
(Make Way! Keep Clear!)

283
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:41,580
- Good!
- Good!

284
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:47,590
- Good!
- Good!

285
00:12:49,460 --> 00:12:52,180
- Good!
- Good!

286
00:13:00,820 --> 00:13:02,460
The prisoner procession
won't be this far ahead.

287
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:03,460
Let's look farther back.

288
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:11,500
Sinners suffer in flesh and bone,

289
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:14,020
Praying to ward off
illness and disaster.

290
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:15,940
Pass through the Underworld Court,

291
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,860
And spare your family
all illness and misfortune.

292
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:20,300
Sinners suffer in flesh and bone,

293
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:22,820
Praying to ward off
illness and disaster.

294
00:13:22,860 --> 00:13:24,740
Pass through the Underworld Court,

295
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:26,580
And spare your family
all illness and misfortune.

296
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:28,800
Sinners suffer in flesh and bone,

297
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,800
Praying to ward off
illness and disaster.

298
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:32,260
Yiyi! Yiyi!

299
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:33,860
Mr. Ding.

300
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:34,620
Mrs. Kuang.

301
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:37,940
Where's Yiyi?

302
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:39,300
She's gone missing.

303
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:40,060
Missing?

304
00:13:40,060 --> 00:13:41,220
We were walking side by side

305
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:42,060
at the City God Temple just now.

306
00:13:42,060 --> 00:13:44,300
I looked away for a moment,
and she was gone.

307
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:45,020
Don't panic.

308
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:45,820
Let's split up and look for her.

309
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:47,100
Yiyi!

310
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:48,780
Madam.

311
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:50,620
Let's go.

312
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:55,620
Yiyi!

313
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:04,020
Yiyi!

314
00:14:05,700 --> 00:14:06,540
Ding Yiyi!

315
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:07,500
Yiyi!

316
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:10,820
Yiyi!

317
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:12,180
Ding Yiyi!

318
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:15,460
Everyone.

319
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:17,380
Boss Ren.

320
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:21,860
Father, everyone.

321
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:23,980
The altar is ready.

322
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:25,620
We can begin the ceremony.

323
00:14:25,940 --> 00:14:26,740
Please.

324
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:27,210
Please.

325
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:28,220
Please.

326
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:41,340
Everyone,

327
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:44,580
today is the fifteenth day of the
seventh lunar month, the Ghost Festival.

328
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:46,260
We've set up an altar for offerings,

329
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:48,580
with sacrificial animals,
soup, and rice,

330
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:51,980
to honor the wandering spirits
without descendants to worship them.

331
00:14:52,820 --> 00:14:54,980
We honor the gods by
observing the proper rites.

332
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:58,780
May the City God
preside over the ceremony.

333
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,220
Father.

334
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:07,020
Boss Kuang.

335
00:15:19,900 --> 00:15:21,780
First bow to the City God.

336
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:25,900
Let the affairs of the dead
be judged in the underworld,

337
00:15:26,980 --> 00:15:28,380
and those of the living
be judged in this world.

338
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:30,580
Lord City God,

339
00:15:31,620 --> 00:15:32,780
forgive us for this interruption.

340
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:35,060
But the wrongs of the living

341
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,900
must also be brought
before you for judgment.

342
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:40,740
Second bow to the City God.

343
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:45,060
Something terrible has happened!

344
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:48,260
The murdered girls have brought
their grievances before the underworld!

345
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:50,660
Lord City God,
please grant them justice!

346
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:52,860
What is this?

347
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:54,500
It's about the cases from this morning.

348
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,020
Yiyi.

349
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:58,660
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

350
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,260
Yiyi.

351
00:16:01,500 --> 00:16:03,220
How dare they cause trouble today?

352
00:16:03,580 --> 00:16:04,420
Find whoever is responsible

353
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:05,300
and kill them!

354
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:06,820
Wait.

355
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:07,940
Boss Kuang.

356
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,140
Before the City God,

357
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:10,140
we must not take a life.

358
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:11,340
Father.

359
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:12,940
They won't be able
to cause much trouble.

360
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:14,500
The ceremony is more important.

361
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:17,820
Today is the grand day
of the City God procession.

362
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:20,220
Paying tribute to the City God
must come first.

363
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:21,060
Everyone.

364
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:22,300
Come.

365
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:25,060
Third bow to the City God.

366
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:28,020
Make way.

367
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:28,740
Let me through!

368
00:16:28,740 --> 00:16:29,620
Excuse me.

369
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:30,700
Yiyi!

370
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:35,060
Lord City God,

371
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,460
forgive the offense.

372
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,380
(Severely Punish the Powerful Murderers)
Give me back my daughter!

373
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,100
Lord City God, please grant us justice!

374
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:42,460
Murderers must pay with their lives!

375
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:48,220
Give me back my daughter!

376
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:49,820
Excuse me.

377
00:17:00,970 --> 00:17:01,820
Lv Mengde.

378
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:04,950
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

379
00:17:05,590 --> 00:17:08,590
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

380
00:17:09,230 --> 00:17:11,990
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

381
00:17:11,990 --> 00:17:13,950
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

382
00:17:13,950 --> 00:17:15,510
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

383
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:17,470
♪But I refuse to fall♪

384
00:17:17,470 --> 00:17:22,510
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

385
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:24,990
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

386
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:28,990
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

387
00:17:29,390 --> 00:17:32,270
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

388
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:35,190
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

389
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:38,630
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

390
00:17:38,630 --> 00:17:42,030
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

391
00:17:43,310 --> 00:17:45,950
♪Those who have hurt me♪

392
00:17:46,590 --> 00:17:49,270
♪I choose to pierce through♪

393
00:17:50,950 --> 00:17:52,430
♪To tear apart♪

394
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:58,510
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

395
00:18:00,070 --> 00:18:02,070
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

396
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:05,070
♪Nor bow to power♪

397
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:07,510
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

398
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:12,950
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
